# the cause. The wings' art was placed against one body, the stock look 128, and a class look stands up to 16 px further
# left or right in its tile; the wings also differ by 6 px between packs. Facing south the wings' pair centre sat a median
# 3.4 px right of a class look's torso (Warrior 12.4, Monk -4.1).
# Now Outfit::draw adds an x shift to the wings' destination (both draw orders): bodyCentre - wingsCentre - 6, so the wings'
# pair centre lands on the torso of the body drawn, per direction. The two tables (body torso x per look and direction,
