# client_chaos_wingfit through the new Lua functions setOutfitBodyCentre, setOutfitWingsCentre and clearOutfitWingCentres.
# A look or wings without a row gets no shift (the draw as before); wings and body that both carry Bones keep the Bones
# placement; the bob, the walk, the mount rules and the lift are untouched.
